[h1]今古群侠传 · 民间修改器 + 数据查询站[/h1]
[h1]JinGu · Open-Source Mod + Data Reference Site[/h1]

一个为单人游戏体验制作的开源工具,旨在节省重复劳动 (刷怪、采集、好感度等), 让玩家把时间花在剧情和探索上.
[i]A community-built mod for the single-player wuxia RPG. Skips repetitive grind (mob loops, gathering, affection farming) so you can spend more time on story and exploration.[/i]

[b]完全单机使用, 不影响联机或他人. / Single-player only. Does not affect multiplayer or other players.[/b]

