[url=https://tantk.github.io/psychic-kungfu-master-mod/]tantk.github.io/psychic-kungfu-master-mod[/url]

[list]
[*][b]物品 / Items[/b] — 全部 948 件,按游戏内分类查询,可按价值/品质排序 / browse all 948 items by game category, sort by value or quality
[*][b]礼物 / Gifts[/b] — 每位 NPC 喜欢/特喜爱/讨厌哪些礼物,按门派筛选 / what each NPC likes / specially loves / hates, filter by faction
