[h2]💾 安装 / Install[/h2]
[olist]
[*]从上面 Releases 页下载 [b]JinGuCheats-Setup-v0.1.0.exe[/b] / Download [b]JinGuCheats-Setup-v0.1.0.exe[/b] from the Releases link above
[*]双击运行. SmartScreen 拦截时点 "更多信息" → "仍要运行" / Double-click to run. If SmartScreen warns, click [b]More info → Run anyway[/b]
[*]安装向导自动检测游戏目录、修补 Mono 运行库、复制文件 / The wizard auto-detects the game folder, patches the Mono runtime, drops mod files into Mods\
[*]启动游戏即可,作弊界面会自动弹出 / Launch the game through Steam — the cheat UI window opens automatically
[/olist]

完整说明 / Full README:
[url=https://github.com/tantk/psychic-kungfu-master-mod#readme]github.com/tantk/psychic-kungfu-master-mod#readme[/url]

