[h2]⚠ 杀毒软件提示 / About Antivirus[/h2]
Windows Defender 等杀软可能会拦截 dll 文件 — 因为 mod 需要 hook 进游戏进程, 这种技术与恶意软件相同. [b]源代码完全开源[/b], 可以自行审查.
[i]Windows Defender and other AV products may flag the cheat DLL — it hooks into another process and uses reflection, which is the same technique malware uses. The source is fully open for inspection.[/i]

被拦截时的处理 / If flagged:
[list]
[*]允许文件 (Windows 安全中心 → 病毒和威胁防护 → 允许的威胁) / Allow the file (Windows Security → Virus & threat protection → Allowed threats)
[*]或将游戏目录加入排除项 / or add an exclusion for the game folder
[/list]

